      "worked_solution": "The volume $V$ of a cube can be found using the formula\n\n$$\nV = s^3,\n$$\n\nwhere $s$ is the side length of the cube.\n\nSubstituting $s=4\\,\\textrm{cm}$ into the formula, we get \n\n$$\nV = (4\\, \\textrm{cm})^3 = 64\\, \\textrm{cm}^3 .\n$$",
